{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 15 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图神经网络：当边、拓扑和关系本身就是医学信息</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Graph &amp; Mesh Networks</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_135_vox2cortex-title\">Vox2Cortex</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Vox2Cortex 将 3D U-Net 特征在顶点处采样，并以 GCN 同时形变四个互相关联的皮层表面。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Jointly deforms four topologically coupled brain cortical hemisphere templates (left/right white and pial surfaces) in seconds using 3D U-Net voxel features and Residual GCNs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D T1-weighted brain MRI 与四个初始皮层模板表面</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D T1-weighted brain MRI + 4 initialized template meshes (~168,000 total vertices)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">左右半球 white 与 pial 四个显式 cortical meshes</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">4 high-resolution, topologically genus-zero cortical meshes (LH/RH white matter and pial surfaces)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Bongratz_Vox2Cortex_Fast_Explicit_Reconstruction_of_Cortical_Surfaces_From_3D_MRI_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Vox2Cortex original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/fe3ed684cf120b7103b1.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_135_vox2cortex\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_135_vox2cortex\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D brain MRI</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D brain MRI</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">体素强度提供皮层边界和解剖上下文</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d t1-weighted brain mri + 4 initialized template meshes (~168,000 total vertices) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D brain MRI).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"体素强度提供皮层边界和解剖上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d t1-weighted brain mri + 4 initialized template meshes (~168,000 total vertices) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D brain MRI).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D brain MRI\" data-node-name-en=\"3D brain MRI\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D brain MRI</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体素强度提供皮层边界和解剖上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d t1-weighted brain mri + 4 initialized template meshes (~168,000 total vertices) and prepares initial tensor representations (3D brain MRI).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"提取多尺度体素特征并可辅助体素分割\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D U-Net feature pyramid to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D U-Net feature pyramid\" data-node-name-en=\"3D U-Net feature pyramid\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D U-Net feature pyramid</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">提取多尺度体素特征并可辅助体素分割</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D U-Net feature pyramid to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"左右 white/pial 表面具有固定且对应的拓扑\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs cortical meshes within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"四个初始 cortical meshes\" data-node-name-en=\"cortical meshes\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四个初始 cortical meshes</span><span class=\"lang-en\">cortical meshes</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">左右 white/pial 表面具有固定且对应的拓扑</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs cortical meshes within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在每个 mesh 顶点处查询 U-Net 多尺度特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Trilinear feature sampling within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Trilinear feature sampling\" data-node-name-en=\"Trilinear feature sampling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Trilinear feature sampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在每个 mesh 顶点处查询 U-Net 多尺度特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Trilinear feature sampling within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"聚合局部 mesh 邻域与体素证据，预测各表面顶点位移\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Graph convolution blocks within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Graph convolution blocks\" data-node-name-en=\"Graph convolution blocks\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Graph convolution blocks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">聚合局部 mesh 邻域与体素证据，预测各表面顶点位移</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Graph convolution blocks within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多次更新四表面并保持 white/pial 对应关系\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Coarse-to-fine deformation stages within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Coarse-to-fine deformation stages\" data-node-name-en=\"Coarse-to-fine deformation stages\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Coarse-to-fine deformation stages</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多次更新四表面并保持 white/pial 对应关系</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Coarse-to-fine deformation stages within the core coupled multi surface cortical gcn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"约束几何精度、网格质量和皮层层间结构\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Surface/normal/edge/inter-surface losses to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Surface/normal/edge/inter-surface losses\" data-node-name-en=\"Surface/normal/edge/inter-surface losses\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Surface/normal/edge/inter-surface losses</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">约束几何精度、网格质量和皮层层间结构</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Surface/normal/edge/inter-surface losses to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"快速显式输出，可计算厚度和皮层形态\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces 4 high-resolution, topologically genus-zero cortical meshes (lh/rh white matter and pial surfaces) via White/pial cortical surfaces.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"White/pial cortical surfaces\" data-node-name-en=\"White/pial cortical surfaces\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_135_vox2cortex', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>White/pial cortical surfaces</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">快速显式输出，可计算厚度和皮层形态</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces 4 high-resolution, topologically genus-zero cortical meshes (lh/rh white matter and pial surfaces) via White/pial cortical surfaces.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Vox2Cortex Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 保持模板拓扑的多皮层表面联合形变</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Coupled Multi-Surface Cortical Mesh Deformation via Continuous ODE-like GCN Steps &amp; Curvature Regularization</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Vox2Cortex：核心公式 · 保持模板拓扑的多皮层表面联合形变\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"135\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"13.212872pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.6553