304251\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-97\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"161.533345\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-109\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"167.191529\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-102\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"169.358795\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-101\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"172.587889\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-114\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"177.73619\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-184\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"186.156782\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g13-95\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"191.881313\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g10-61\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"196.775056\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"204.436317\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-110\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"208.072682\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-111\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"211.709047\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-114\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"214.276319\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-109\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"219.934502\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-97\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"223.163596\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-108\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"227.897365\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-184\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"236.317957\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g13-95\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"241.969759\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g10-52\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"246.532578\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"254.193839\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-101\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"257.422933\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-100\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"261.059298\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-103\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"264.513835\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-101\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"270.454897\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-184\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"278.875489\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g13-95\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"284.8182\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g10-33\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"290.384664\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g7-76\" y=\"-58.92188\"></use><use x=\"298.045925\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-76\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"302.489564\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-97\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use><use x=\"305.718658\" xlink:href=\"#m135_g17-112\" y=\"-57.4275\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">传统皮层重建流程耗时且多阶段，通用 mesh 模型难满足嵌套皮层拓扑</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Classical FreeSurfer cortical surface reconstruction required 4–8 hours of CPU optimization per scan, while voxel segmenters failed to prevent self-intersections in tight sulci.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">由 3D MRI 体素特征驱动多表面 mesh deformation，同时预测皮层内外表面</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Drive 4 coupled template meshes simultaneously through multiple Euler-like deformation steps conditioned on multi-scale 3D CNN features sampled at vertex coordinates.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">联合 U-Net 体特征、图卷积和表面正则快速重建多层皮层</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Inter- and intra-surface geometric constraints preventing white/pial self-intersection + 1,000× speedup (&lt;20 seconds vs. hours in FreeSurfer).</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于脑 MRI white/pial cortical surface extraction</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High-speed neuroimaging baseline for cortical thickness analysis, Alzheimer's atrophy tracking, and large biobank processing.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">显式神经解剖表面强基线；异常 anatomy 与跨扫描协议仍具挑战</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Domain-specialized explicit surface landmark; severe brain tumors or strokes that disrupt normal cortical topology remain challenging.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">用 3D U-Net 提供体素域多尺度证据，用 GCN 维护显式皮层 mesh 拓扑。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">同时形变左右半球的 white 与 pial 表面，而非独立逐表面重建。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">粗到细顶点更新和表面几何正则使输出可直接用于皮层测量。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Drive 4 coupled template meshes simultaneously through multiple Euler-like deformation steps conditioned on multi-scale 3D CNN features sampled at vertex coordinates.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Inter- and intra-surface geometric constraints preventing white/pial self-intersection + 1,000× speedup (&lt;20 seconds vs. hours in FreeSurfer).</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Coupled Multi-Surface Cortical Mesh Deformation via Continuous ODE-like GCN Steps &amp; Curvature Regularization.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">面向脑 MRI white/pial surface extraction，可直接计算皮层厚度和表面形态。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">模板拓扑和训练人群先验可能限制异常皮层、术后缺损或严重畸形；需检查自交、拓扑和亚毫米偏差。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: High-speed neuroimaging baseline for cortical thickness analysis, Alzheimer's atrophy tracking, and large biobank processing.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Domain-specialized explicit surface landmark; severe brain tumors or strokes that disrupt normal cortical topology remain challenging.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Bongratz_Vox2Cortex_Fast_Explicit_Reconstruction_of_Cortical_Surfaces_From_3D_MRI_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Vox2Cortex: Fast Explicit Reconstruction of Cortical Surfaces from 3D MRI</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/ai-med/Vox2Cortex\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
